{"summary":"The traditional Spanish card game La Brisca.","description":"La Brisca (Briscola), the classic Spanish card game.\n\nHIGHLIGHTS\n✔ <b>Deck cards in high definition</b>.\n✔ Possibility to select the <b>Spanish deck</b>, standard french deck or Italian (napoletane).\n✔ Now you can also change the <b>card size</b>.\n✔ Lots of high definition reverses.\n✔ Incredible animations and effects.\n✔ Play Online with friends or Offline vs AI.\n✔ Simple and minimalist interface.\n✔ Includes a <b>Tutorial</b> and a very complete help.\n✔ Realistic sounds with the possibility of adjusting the volume.\n✔ Optimized graphics to use less battery.\n✔ All Briscola rules are customizable.\n✔ Portrait or landscape orientation.\n✔ And a lot more...\n\nBRISCOLA GAME\nLa Brisca also called Briscola or Briscas is a popular card game in Spain, Italy, Puerto Rico, Cuba, and many other countries. The App includes a complete tutorial, as well as very detailed help, statistics, configuration options, etc.\n\nGAME MODES\n★ Tutorial.\n★ Practice mode (allows you to undo the movements)\n★ Single player (5 difficulty levels)\n★ Play with friends (4 players)\n★ Online Play with events, tournaments, ranks...\n\nJust one more thing...\nENJOY IT !!!\n\n--------------------\nAny suggestion or bug report is welcome: write to us at hello@quarzoapps.com. We always reply!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$6.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iV1bz6KUiSY?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jUvEJckPRzfc4boxSwwOM64E5HLZxaSn0DcBKPH0YW5DgyyCgB3g-VabF_CPOlB_W-vBwnh1GLYrk5PWZFt7","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rtT_rA2k726y7eayHECL8FqKscd0yonmp4SXKeUNXe1fEnbJ8D18OuBNP-WkTF8MfE5eCwssDrjqK5g9evg87g","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1xhIM9NBFjqIshGHG1ZiMvImkjr7DhjnoB8UT_QqDjXQ6f3uSw41fvDQCjHotcoN4ovWbClbsdfaslSxZEeBdQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EfjNpV79_JzQawxY-QcFBVoL0sQSckyo6kFUQRRds0l